  "bodyText": "About Rentals Manage Listings Build A Portfolio Knowledge Town Log In Renter Landlord Agent Find your perfect space Discover properties, schedule tours, submit applications and move with confidence. Find Your Next Home Rent State Select State LGA Select LGA Property Type Property type Amount Select rent range Bedrooms 0 Bathrooms 0 Clear filters Apply Filters HOW IT WORKS Just 6 steps. But who’s counting? We’ve simplified the rental process, from verified search to move-in, so you can focus on finding a home you can trust. 01 Discover Find verified properties that match your location, budget, and needs. 02 OPTIONAL Tour Request a viewing with the verified landlord or assigned agent, or apply directly if you are ready. 03 Apply Apply with your verified profile and required documents, all in one place. 04 Sign Once approved, review and sign your lease digitally with the landlord. MOST IMPORTANT 05 Pay Make your payment through Nyangu, with your transaction documented and protected. 06 Move In and Stay on Top Get your keys, settle in, and manage your lease, payments, maintenance requests, and landlord communication from your dashboard. Find Your Next Home Rent with Confidence Verified listings, protected payments, and added safeguards from search to move-in. Trust is built into the process. Verified from the Start We verify renters, landlords, agents, and property listings, so you know who and what you are dealing with. Protected Payments Your initial rent and fees are securely held and are not released to the landlord until 2 business days after your documented payment date. 24 Hour Safeguard If something is seriously wrong after payment, such as being denied access or the property materially differing from the listing, report it within 24 hours. If confirmed, your payment is refunded. Built for a market that needs proof. Verified People Know who you are dealing with. Verified Properties Know the property is real. Protected Transactions Know where your 